WEBVTT

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:03.420
It fine-tunes
your brain's social instincts.

00:08:03.978 --> 00:08:05.951
It primes you to do things

00:08:05.975 --> 00:08:08.891
that strengthen close relationships.

00:08:09.486 --> 00:08:14.310
Oxytocin makes you crave physical contact
with your friends and family.

00:08:14.334 --> 00:08:15.896
It enhances your empathy.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.604
It even makes you more willing
to help and support

00:08:18.628 --> 00:08:20.312
the people you care about.

00:08:21.672 --> 00:08:25.626
Some people have even suggested
we should snort oxytocin...

00:08:27.179 --> 00:08:29.867
to become more compassionate and caring.